{{PageBanner|Clb l 001 3 en.png|event}}
A collaboration event between [[Nyanko Daisensou]] and the popular Vocaloid singer known as '''Hatsune Miku''' (初音ミク, ''Hatsune Miku'', '''Hatsune Miku''') was originally held from March 9th, 2020 to March 23rd, 2020. The collaboration includes an [[Hatsune Miku Collaboration Event/Gacha Drop|exclusive Gacha]], stages, [[Catnip Challenges]] and stamps going on during collaboration period.

==Event Information==
Hatsune Miku gets Cat-fied... for winter!<br>
Battle Cats x Hatsune Miku Collab returns for one final event!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Join in on the fun from April 8th (11am) through April 22nd, 2024 (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF00FF|'''● Hatsune Miku Collab Capsules'''}}<br>
Virtual singers from an electric dimension have warped into the Cat Empire!<br>
For a limited time, select the Hatsune Miku tab at the top of the Rare Capsule menu for a chance to collect powerful Uber Rare collab characters only available during this event!<br>
During this event, a NEW hero {{Color|#0000FF|'''Hatsune Miku XVI joins'''}} the rest of the cast of digital divas and friends in an exclusive collab-only Rare Capsule set!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Limited edition collab units include...'''}}<br>
{{Color|#0000FF|'''NEW UNIT:'''}} [[Hatsune Miku XVI (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#0000FF|'''Hatsune Miku XVI (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Diva who has stirred imaginations with melody for 16 years!<br>
Strong versus Black enemies, with Area Surge attacks that Slow enemies!

[[Hatsune Miku (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#339966|'''Hatsune Miku (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
A cute & stylish electric pop diva! Strong vs. & Weakens Red, Floating, Angels (Area Attack)

[[Kagamine Rin & Len (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF9900|'''Kagamine Rin & Len (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Powerful and charming twin vocals. Long-Range Area attacks might Knockback/Slow Black & Metal!

[[Sakura Miku (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Sakura Miku (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Diva who dances among the cherry blossoms. Area attacks Freeze Aliens and might break Barriers.

[[Megurine Luka (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#800080|'''Megurine Luka (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Laid-back bilingual vocalist with a silky smooth voice.<br>
Massive Long-Range Area Damage to Floating/Black

[[Hatsune Miku: MM2020 Osaka (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Hatsune Miku MM 2020 Osaka (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
A new version of Miku with a special look to celebrate her appearance in Osaka for Magical Mirai 2020!<br>
Massive Area Attack damage vs Red & Angel enemies, with a chance of Savage Blow!

[[Hatsune Miku: MM2020 Tokyo (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#3366FF|'''Hatsune Miku MM 2020 Tokyo (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
A new version of Miku with a special look to celebrate her appearance in Tokyo for Magical Mirai 2020!<br>
Super tough vs Red & Angel enemies! Plus, negates enemy Wave attacks, and has Area Attack!

[[Snow Miku 2021 (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#00CCFF|'''Snow Miku 2021 (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
A radiant ice sculpture come to life!<br>
Tough vs Traitless enemies! Long-Range Area attacks with a chance to Freeze!

[[MEIKO & Cat (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''MEIKO & Cat (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Massive Long-Range Area Damage to Red<br>
[[KAITO & Cat (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#0000FF|'''KAITO ＆ Cat (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Tough vs. Zombies, with Area Attack!<br>
[[Luka Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Luka Cat (Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Chance to Dodge Alien attacks<br>
[[Neko Rin (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Neko Rin (Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Chance to Dodge Black enemy attacks!<br>
[[Neko Len (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FFCC00|'''Neko Len (Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Chance to Dodge Metal enemy attacks!

※ The Uber Rare units listed above will have a set chance to appear from Rare Capsule draws during this event. Standard non-Collab Rare and Super Rare units may also be received during this event.<br>
※ Hatsune Miku limited collab units are not available from any Rare Capsule set aside from the Hatsune Miku collab capsules. Tap the Hatsune Miku tab at the top of the Rare Capsules menu to draw from this set.<br>
※ If the Hatsune Miku capsule set option does not appear in your app during the time listed above, please update your The Battle Cats app to the most recent version.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Collab Stages in The Battle Cats'''}}<br>
The virtual singer worldwide tour arrives in the Cat Empire for the final dates! Take on limited special stages featuring Hatsune Miku and friends!<br>
Visit the Legend Stages during this collab event and select the Hatsune Miku map to take on crossover stages!

※ If Hatsune Miku collab stages do not appear in the Legend/Event Stages during this event, please ensure that your Battle Cats app is updated to the most recent version available.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Collab Map: "Hatsune Miku"'''}}<br>
Clearing any stage in this map for a small chance to unlock {{Color|#FF00FF|'''limited collab unit'''}} [[Miku Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Miku Cat'''}}]]!<br>
More difficult later stages in the map will give you a better chance at collecting Miku Cat! Or you can use a Treasure Radar on any map for a 100% chance to earn this exclusive unit as a drop reward!

※ After collecting Miku Cat, activate her for use by visiting the Rare Cats section of the Upgrade menu.<br>
※ If you have collected Miku Cat from a previous event, you cannot receive the unit a second time.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Restored Clear Rewards for Collab Map: "MIKU EXPO"!'''}}<br>
Hatsune Miku joins Kagamine Rin & Len for a spectacular world tour to delight virtual singer fans around the globe!<br>
Battle to the beat of beloved Miku songs like "Senbonzakura", and collect tons of bonus XP rewards!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Blitz Stage: "MIKU CHERRY"'''}}<br>
Check out collab stages heralding the arrival of spring, featuring Hatsune Miku music including hit track "Teo"!
Get awesome bonus item rewards upon stage clear!<br>
These Expert-difficulty stages are only available during this event at the times below! Don't miss out on these extra rewards!<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''6:00am～8:59am'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''12:00pm～2:59pm'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''7:00pm～10:59pm'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Restored clear rewards for Collab Stage "SNOW MIKU"'''}}<br>
TTake on Hatsune Miku's newest form in new stage series SNOW MIKU, aimed at high-level Battle Cats veterans! This map features the SNOW MIKU 2021 theme song "Fondant Step" as the backing track to your battle with the virtual singer's army!<br>
Earn {{Color|#00CCFF|'''Cat Ticket'''}} and {{Color|#00CCFF|'''Rare Ticket'''}} rewards based on your timed score when you clear these stages!

※ Tap the Timed Score button at bottom left of the Map menu to show the list of available rewards!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・NEW STAGES: Get front-row seats to a special concert series with weekend-only Blitz Maps!'''}}<br>
Enjoy two limited maps, {{Color|#3366FF|'''"Weekend Concert: Day 1"'''}} and {{Color|#3366FF|'''"Weekend Concert: Day 2"'''}} during the scheduled times listed below!

{{Color|#3366FF|'''Weekend Concert: Day 1'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''April 13th (12:00am) ~ April 14th (11:59pm)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''April 20th (12:00am) ~ April 21st (11:59pm)'''}}<br>
Clear for a reward of {{Color|#00CCFF|'''up to 100 Cat Food upon victory'''}}!

{{Color|#3366FF|'''Weekend Concert: Day 2'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''April 20th (12:00am) ~ April 21st (11:59pm)'''}}<br>
Clear for a reward of {{Color|#00CCFF|'''Cat Tickets and a Rare Ticket'''}}!

Get ready for the show of the century when Hatsune Miku XVI takes the stage'''}}!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Restored clear rewards for Collab Gauntlet Map "THE ELECTRIC DIVA STRIKES!"'''}}<br>
A gauntlet challenge appearing just for this edition of the Hatsune Miku collab with The Battle Cats! Can you overcome a gauntlet of tough collab enemies to clear all 20 Levels! Get more rewards with every stage you pass!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Special Catclaw Dojo Stage: "MikuMiku Music Fest"'''}}<br>
Celebrate the summer return of Hatsune Miku with a special ranking challenge event, {{Color|#FF00FF|'''available between April 8th (11:00am) and April 22nd (10:59am)!'''}}

Visit the Catclaw Dojo's special collab event {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Miku Miku Music Fest'''}} and pit your score against a world of the Battle Cats fans as you race to the top of the leaderboards!<br>
Can you defeat enough enemies within the time limit to rank in the top 1% of players?<br>
Clear the stage, get a high score and earn rewards based on your score tier at the end of this collab-only Dojo challenge!

※ Rewards may take a short time to be delivered after your final ranking tier is determined. Please be patient!<br>
※ Your Ranking Result will be shown in the Catclaw Dojo, but rewards will be claimed by visiting the Mailbox menu from the Battle Cats title screen. Rewards will expire and become unclaimable 30 days after delivery.<br>
※ Exiting the Battle screen during an Arena challenge will not restore spent Cat Food.<br>
※ Network connection is required to play the Arena of Honor.<br>
※ Scores achieved during this ranking event will be reset once the next ranking event begins.<br>
※ Accounts flagged for hacking or modding will have their Arena scores invalidated and may receive a play ban.<br>
※ Empire of Cats Ch. 1 must be cleared before the Catclaw Dojo will be available to access.<br>
※ If the Arena of Honor does not become available during this event, please ensure that your Battle Cats app is updated to the most recent version available.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Limited Gamatoto Expedition Event!'''}}<br>
During this event, visit the Gamatoto Exhibitions to send your adventurers to collect glorious loot, while Snow Miku's loyal pet Rabbit Yukine tags along with the Gamatoto crew and help collect extra XP and item rewards! Don't miss out!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Special Missions in the Catnip Challenges!'''}}<br>
Collect limited-time mission rewards by completing Hatsune Miku stages!<br>
Once you've met the requirements, head to the Catnip Challenges and accept your prizes!

※These Special missions can only be completed until April 22nd, 2024 at 10:59am, so don't forget to claim your rewards before then!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Login daily to earn items and a Rare Ticket!'''}}<br>
Every day you visit the Cat Base during this collab event, you will be rewarded with a login stamp that provides another awesome item reward.<br>
Play every day and don't miss out on any of the 14 days of free gifts, including one Rare Ticket!

